<!-- [WOLF ADVENTURE P1 2026-10-16] Wolf World > Adventure Studio... (STUDIO_AND_CONSOLE_V1.md §2, P1 "Studio
     Lite": Home, Import, Publish). Drawn in the wolfGame family by WolfAdventureStudioView
     (wolffloateradventurestudio.cpp): the pages on a left rail, the page in the centre, the problems
     and help in a right drawer, a status line at the foot. §1 "The minimum is 900 x 600 UI units".
     The 34 px drag strip lies under the drawn title band.
     [MINIMIZE 2026-10-17] can_minimize: the band's "-" calls LLFloater::setMinimized (llfloater.cpp:1383); the viewer's
     standard minimized bar then shows the title and its Restore button (llfloater.cpp:2225-2231 draws the buttons and the
     drag handle; handleMouseDown :1832 offers the click to BUTTON_RESTORE). The floater's own minimize button is hidden
     by WolfFloaterAdventureStudio::updateTitleButtons.
     [START POSITION 2026-10-17] positioning="centered": the first open is centred (llfloater.cpp applyPositioning :1109-1116);
     save_rect="true" keeps the rect across sessions (applyRectControl :1002-1050; the "floater" settings group is
     gSavedSettings, llappviewer.cpp:1054), and onOpen clamps it into the floater area (adjustToFitScreen :3242). -->
<floater
 can_close="false"
 can_drag_on_left="false"
 can_minimize="true"
 can_resize="true"
 header_height="34"
 height="680"
 layout="topleft"
 legacy_header_height="34"
 min_height="600"
 min_width="900"
 name="wolf_adventure_studio"
 positioning="centered"
 save_rect="true"
 show_title="false"
 single_instance="true"
 title="Adventure Studio (Experimental)"
 width="980">
    <wolf_adventure_studio_view
     follows="all"
     height="680"
     layout="topleft"
     left="0"
     mouse_opaque="false"
     name="studio"
     tab_stop="true"
     top="0"
     width="980" />
</floater>
